      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think we should bather with any other events if we are resetting the tpm here.\n\nThe two other options are commiting nvmem and executing a tpm command.\n\nThe reset will commit nvmem, and will prevent the tpm command from proper execution, there is no point in continuing if this is a reset request.",
